      "index": 0,
      "text": "View Split ScreenCollapse ThreadsFilter bySearch entries or author...Sort bySEQUENCES AND SERIES (MTH_253Z_400_U2026) Available from Jun 29 12am until Jul 12 11:59pmUnsubscribedManage DiscussionDiscussion Topic: Unit 2 is underway!Unit 2 is underway! Hi everyone, I hope you are all having an awesome weekend! We are officially in Unit 2 now, and this unit will be completed during Weeks 2 and 3. Please view the Unit 2 Learning Materials page for all of the lecture videos and notes for this module. The required assignments can be found in the Unit 2 Overview page. We do not have a required discussion board in this unit, but we have two required Web Homework assignments due in Achieve, one required Written Assignment due in Gradescope, and the Unit 2 quiz due in Week 4. Your Unit 1 quiz grades will be posted this afternoon. As always, please don't hesitate to let me know if you have any questions! You can post them into the Unit 2 Q&A discussion board or send me an email. Have a great rest of your week! Best, Radu.This topic is closed for comments."
    },
